  "term": "SMART",
  "definition": "In this packet, SMART refers to a smart classroom environment: a technology-enhanced learning setting that provides multiple instructional resources or supports. It is described as a context that can promote student engagement partly by increasing positive emotions such as foreign language enjoyment.",
